      "content": "Thank you so much for reaching out, and please accept our sincerest apologies regarding the delay with your shipment. I completely understand how frustrating this must be, and I appreciate you bringing this to our attention so we can fix it right away. I have immediately looked into your order and can confirm an updated delivery timeline for you. Please let me know if you have any other questions so I can ensure this is resolved to your complete satisfaction.",
