      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a decent start, pretty standard professional stuff. But honestly, it's not scoring very high on the tool. I just ran it through the sentiment classifier and the positivity_index is only around 0.6. \n\nFor the manual, we really need a \"Gold Standard\" example that looks incredibly positive to show what \"maximum positivity\" looks like in a corporate context. Even though I said not to go overboard, we need to see what the ceiling is for this metric. Can you try to rewrite it so the positivity score is much higher? Try to get it closer to a 0.9 or 1.0.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
